          "**Severe attack**: **talks in words, sits hunched forward, agitated, accessory muscles in use, respiratory rate over 30/min, pulse over 120/min, SpO2 under 90%, PEF 50% or less** - start treatment and arrange transfer to acute care. [GINA 2025]",
